  {"text": "Just for a second.", "tag": "[quietly]", "pause": 0.4},
  {"text": "He thought he imagined it.", "tag": "[uneasy]"},
  {"text": "Until it happened again.", "tag": "[tense]", "pause": 0.4},
  {"text": "This time, the entire sky went black.", "tag": "[dramatic]", "pause": 0.4},
  {"text": "For one second, Lucas saw thousands of stars.", "tag": "[in awe]"},
  {"text": "And something enormous standing behind the sun.", "tag": "[fearful]", "pause": 0.6},
  {"text": "The next morning, Lucas climbed the tallest building in town.", "tag": "[determined]"},
  {"text": "He pointed a telescope toward the sky.", "tag": "[curious]"},
  {"text": "And discovered the truth.", "tag": "[ominous]", "pause": 0.5},
  {"text": "The sun wasn't a sun.", "tag": "[shocked]"},
  {"text": "It was a giant lightbulb.", "tag": "[shocked]"},
  {"text": "Hanging from an enormous ceiling.", "tag": "[fearful]", "pause": 0.5},
  {"text": "Suddenly, the lightbulb flickered.", "tag": "[tense]"},
